# Question 1
### Basic Math Operation

Write a print statement to show the result of the calculation (2 + 12) / 7 + 6. This is to verify basic arithmetic operations and output functionality.
<br></br>

# Question 2
### Sum Integers Less Than 100

You have a list of integer values representing data points. Write a while loop that calculates the sum of all values in the list that are less than 100. Print the sum of the values that are less than 100.
<br></br>

# Question 3
### Check for File Extension

You have a list of filenames. Write a loop that iterates through the list and prints any filename that contains the substring ".fasta"
<br></br>